  <%# Mobile mockup (simplified, visible on small screens) %>
  <div class="landing-mockup-mobile">
    <div class="landing-mockup-line brand"></div>
    <div style="margin-top: 24px;"></div>
    <div class="landing-mockup-chat">
      <div class="landing-mockup-avatar"></div>
      <div class="landing-mockup-bubble">
        <div class="landing-mockup-line short"></div>
        <div class="landing-mockup-line"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="landing-mockup-chat" style="margin-top: 16px;">
      <div class="landing-mockup-avatar" style="background: var(--landing-brand);"></div>
      <div class="landing-mockup-bubble">
        <div class="landing-mockup-line"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="philosophy" class="landing-container landing-section">
  <h2>Everything you need.<br>Nothing you don't.</h2>
  <p class="lead">Discord is for gaming. Slack is for work. WhatsApp is for group chats that quickly become unmanageable. Sabha is for the spaces in between.</p>

  <div class="landing-grid">
    <div class="landing-feature-card">
      <div class="landing-feature-icon">
        <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 6.75h16.5M3.75 12h16.5m-16.5 5.25H12"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>No algorithms</h3>
      <p>Just chronological conversation. No algorithmic "highlights" you didn't ask for. You see what was said, when it was said.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="landing-feature-card">
      <div class="landing-feature-icon">
        <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M18.364 18.364A9 9 0 005.636 5.636m12.728 12.728A9 9 0 015.636 5.636m12.728 12.728L5.636 5.636"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>No bot marketplace</h3>
      <p>You're here to talk to humans, not manage an automated army. Keep your community focused on real connections.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="landing-feature-card">
      <div class="landing-feature-icon">
        <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21.752 15.002A9.718 9.718 0 0118 15.75c-5.385 0-9.75-4.365-9.75-9.75 0-1.33.266-2.597.748-3.752A9.753 9.753 0 003 11.25C3 16.635 7.365 21 12.75 21a9.753 9.753 0 009.002-5.998z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>No presence pressure</h3>
      <p>No typing indicators, no blinking "green dot" anxiety. Sabha is built to be async-friendly with real-time speed when you need it.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="landing-campfire landing-section">
  <div class="landing-container">
    <div class="landing-campfire-inner">
      <div class="landing-campfire-icon">
        <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.362 5.214A8.252 8.252 0 0112 21 8.25 8.25 0 016.038 7.048 8.287 8.287 0 009 9.6a8.983 8.983 0 013.361-6.867 8.21 8.21 0 003 2.48z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 18a3.75 3.75 0 00.495-7.467 5.99 5.99 0 00-1.925 3.546 5.974 5.974 0 01-2.133-1.001A3.75 3.75 0 0012 18z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h2>Built on Campfire.<br>By 37signals.</h2>
      <p class="lead" style="margin: 0 auto;">Sabha isn't built from scratch. It's built on <a href="https://once.com/campfire" target="_blank" class="landing-campfire-link">Campfire</a>, the team chat created by 37signals &mdash; the company behind Basecamp, HEY, and Ruby on Rails. That means you get a decade of opinionated product thinking baked into every interaction: simplicity over feature bloat, speed over spectacle, calm over chaos.</p>
      <div class="landing-campfire-credits">
        <div class="landing-campfire-credit">
          <span class="landing-campfire-label">Foundation</span>
          <span>Campfire by 37signals</span>
        </div>
        <div class="landing-campfire-divider"></div>
        <div class="landing-campfire-credit">
          <span class="landing-campfire-label">Stack</span>
          <span>Rails, Hotwire, SQLite</span>
        </div>
        <div class="landing-campfire-divider"></div>
        <div class="landing-campfire-credit">
          <span class="landing-campfire-label">Philosophy</span>
          <span>Small, fast, personal</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="features" class="landing-container landing-section">
  <h2>Your brand. Your rules.<br>Your community.</h2>
  <p class="lead">Stop letting your members feel like they're just "on a server." When they join your Sabha, they are joining <em>your</em> space.</p>

  <div class="landing-grid">
    <div class="landing-feature-card">
      <div class="landing-feature-icon">
        <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.53 16.122a3 3 0 00-5.78 1.128 2.25 2.25 0 01-2.4 2.245 4.5 4.5 0 008.4-2.245c0-.399-.078-.78-.22-1.128zm0 0a15.998 15.998 0 003.388-1.62m-5.043-.025a15.994 15.994 0 011.622-3.395m3.42 3.42a15.995 15.995 0 004.764-4.648l3.876-5.814a1.151 1.151 0 00-1.597-1.597L14.146 6.32a15.996 15.996 0 00-4.649 4.763m3.42 3.42a6.776 6.776 0 00-3.42-3.42"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Custom Identity</h3>
      <p>Set your name, logo, and brand colors. Make it look like a seamless part of your own project, not a generic chat application.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="landing-feature-card">
      <div class="landing-feature-icon">
        <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M20.25 8.511c.884.284 1.5 1.128 1.5 2.097v4.286c0 1.136-.847 2.1-1.98 2.193-.34.027-.68.052-1.02.072v3.091l-3-3c-1.354 0-2.694-.055-4.02-.163a2.115 2.115 0 01-.825-.242m9.345-8.334a2.126 2.126 0 00-.476-.095 48.64 48.64 0 00-8.048 0c-1.131.094-1.976 1.057-1.976 2.192v4.286c0 .837.46 1.58 1.155 1.951m9.345-8.334V6.637c0-1.621-1.152-3.026-2.76-3.235A48.455 48.455 0 0011.25 3c-2.115 0-4.198.137-6.24.402-1.608.209-2.76 1.614-2.76 3.235v6.226c0 1.621 1.152 3.026 2.76 3.235.577.075 1.157.14 1.74.194V21l4.155-4.155"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Threads by Default</h3>
      <p>Keep conversations organized, not buried under a wall of text. Never lose a great, nuanced discussion to the main feed again.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="landing-feature-card">
      <div class="landing-feature-icon">
        <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m21 21-5.197-5.197m0 0A7.5 7.5 0 105.196 5.196a7.5 7.5 0 0010.607 10.607z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Search that Works</h3>
      <p>Everything is archived. Everything is searchable. Your community's history and shared knowledge is their greatest asset.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="landing-how-it-works landing-section">
  <div class="landing-container" style="text-align: center;">
    <h2>Up and running in<br>three steps.</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="margin: 0 auto 40px auto;">No server to configure. No bot permissions to untangle. No 47-page admin panel.</p>

    <div class="landing-steps">
      <div class="landing-step">
        <div class="landing-step-number">1</div>
        <h3>Create your workspace</h3>
        <p>Pick a name, set your brand colors, and you're live. Takes about 30 seconds.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="landing-step-arrow">
        <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="landing-step">
        <div class="landing-step-number">2</div>
        <h3>Invite your people</h3>
        <p>Share a link. No app downloads required &mdash; Sabha works in any browser, on any device.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="landing-step-arrow">
        <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="landing-step">
        <div class="landing-step-number">3</div>
        <h3>Start talking</h3>
        <p>Create rooms, start threads, and let the conversation flow. That's it. No step four.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

