        <div class="landing-pricing-desc">Sign up and start talking. We handle everything.</div>
        <ul class="landing-pricing-features">
          <li>Setup your community in minutes</li>
          <li>Switch between workspaces like slack or discord</li>
          <li>Unlimited members</li>
          <li>Unlimited message history</li>
          <li>Limited only by storage</li>
          <li>Threads &amp; search</li>
          <li>Data export anytime</li>
